{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c42ea974309f59b6037ff4f3addf8e58f53c21e4d0d7de8f941f334f88942287",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d81a0dd96ed60bb025cbf3ff995b5a95f9ecd665e9de12281006e334be14b43c",
      "text": "将心意寄托于无二的色彩",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:233a046c0a5b2246abb704875e119e19a9f1430abbeb4d3c30d0e5d467a69391",
      "text": "恭二和皮埃尔向实询问生日想要什么礼物。然而得到的回答却是“什么我都高兴”，这让两人犯了愁。在与制作人商量后，皮埃尔和恭二准备的礼物究竟是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1cc8d01c0ca2d22d6a4967b4291edcea42f195fdde4887c80d92e5233b1b0b8",
      "text": "实还没来吗？差不多快到了吧？\n好想快点吓他一跳！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad37a5784de400f715bb5b30b5d1abb00df2c165199c0774716467ab359045d7",
      "text": "是啊。再确认一遍吧……\n不做点什么的话静不下心来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db41a5ef9ca69ade484dadb104583c5e4f718b55c8b3bacbed26b412d3589f80",
      "text": "确认！饭菜，OK。\n花花也……好漂亮♪你觉得实会高兴吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0110c8b6534bbefa55f3429fecbe86ff71fba8e41cf83a96e352725547aeeb1a",
      "text": "啊啊，肯定会高兴的。搞不好\n还会高兴得哭出来呢……开玩笑的，怎么可能哭啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:980528191b4b1c707c433c881fbaba699b5912e76841f027998a7f4e8d017874",
      "text": "实会高兴得哭出来？那时候，\n就把我的手帕借给他。所以没关系！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52a57f5dce025d5c62737f513cb6dc9d77cd1148aef179ae54d3352e66b7d7c3",
      "text": "我只是打个比方而已啦……嘛，算了。\n等实先生来了，一定要让他好好高兴一下啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b48bc6b95e4dc6b427028576ec72c35c07d5be27c136fde8ca3d4625b17d7153",
      "text": "你们两个竟然为我做了这束插花，\n太感动了。练习也很努力了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:029af649d5a7678da02f34a514b7e7fe2da40f76577cfc71fceea1936fcaac24",
      "text": "嘛……还算努力吧。毕竟是要送给\n一直跟花打交道的实先生嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d04f35cda84aaf9c94767142b6fba6595962585c83c0153c14569878c9d4e556",
      "text": "真是非常漂亮的插花。\n我充分感受到你们两人的心意了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fbd1470b92da23e6d7bafe9804cbea8d42743154cfb547bf2066b0c4abd03a4",
      "text": "是吗……那就好。\n这里面也包含了我们平时的感谢之情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61898a978ac26d8126ff657c9987f4bc4703d5bd3e2c8ed661ce220ef979c411",
      "text": "嗯，谢谢你们。\n我会好好珍藏起来摆好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53a4c13bf52c87ac5c625f18f8433def90f22b89f515ef603415800a82df2e40",
      "text": "皮埃尔，谢谢你的花。\n我真的很高兴哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97142d74e2e7cff2b020eac31ae631bdad2837e8b1af2d94425b0aef91676bbc",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿。选了店里我认为最漂亮的花。\n就是这朵郁金香！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fbae99cd08ea825ce7b99087f5016ad3c07b8dd6b30c2becefab8b7374b3614",
      "text": "店长告诉我们这是实的生日花。\n用来做礼物正合适♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a338e63c950081f4c18a52d32e1917cc0a323809cdc745c195d2c88b775b4e69",
      "text": "（郁金香的花语是“体贴”。\n……正适合这次的心意啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_2_011_12:1_2_011_12_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db7f4a39ebd97bb5df25760bed805ab61158675ce378a949a678b8ad98c6498d",
      "text": "你们给我的这份美好的体贴，\n我一辈子都不会忘记的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
